    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>ToggleSwitch is used for immediate on/off decisions. It supports disabled state, loading state, custom on/off content, icon content, size variants, motion, and wave feedback.</source>
        <target state="translated">ToggleSwitch 用於即時的開關選擇，支持禁用、加載、自定義開關內容、圖標內容、尺寸變體、動效和波紋反饋。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Switch between two mutually exclusive states with optional text, icons, loading, and size variants.</source>
        <target state="translated">在兩個互斥狀態之間切換，並支持文本、圖標、加載和尺寸變體。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
