    <unit id="SemanticContentDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Content element with block display, overflow hidden, border radius, height, padding, transition animations and other switch content area layout and styles</source>
        <target state="translated">內容元素，包含區塊顯示、溢出隱藏、圓角、高度、內邊距、過渡動畫等開關內容區域的佈局和樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticIndicatorDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Indicator element with absolute positioning, width, height, background color, border radius, shadow, transition animations and other switch handle styles and interactive effects</source>
        <target state="translated">指示器元素，包含絕對定位、寬度、高度、背景色、圓角、陰影、過渡動畫等開關把手的樣式和互動效果</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Use owner-scoped selectors and ToggleSwitch property selectors to customize the published Semantic Parts.</source>
        <target state="translated">使用 owner 作用域選擇器和 ToggleSwitch 屬性選擇器定制已發布的 Semantic Part。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
